# BROKEN TWIN of law 3, every mutating route asks: a route erases through the mutator under `delete-note`, with no
# permit. term hold must refuse it: `bury-at` is `mark private` to permit.tree (check/private.ts, `private-name`).
load ./model
  find natural
  find person
  find shelf
load ./permit
  find bury-at

task erase-route
  take s, like shelf
  take actor, like person
  take at, like natural
  like shelf
  back bury-at(s, at, actor)
